OL,3,GNEWSALeader 'confident' of dropping
OL,4,AClean Air Zone fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlace announced the plans to scrap the
OL,7,FCAZ charges following May's local
OL,8,Felections, which saw Reform form a
OL,9,Fminority administration on the council
OL,10,Fafter winning 29 of the 90 seats
OL,11,Favailable.
